        "statement": "We review and update our contingency plans on a regular basis to provide a reliable supply of products and services to our business.",
        "start_character": 18554,
        "end_character": 18686
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001871509-26-000012",
