        "accession_number": "0001871509-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2024, we opened two restaurants with our Restaurant of the Future (\"RoTF 1.0\") design, a 6,250 square foot restaurant with a 47-foot production line that is more efficient to build and also better reflects the way consumers interact with our brand today.",
        "start_character": 9801,
        "end_character": 10058
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001871509-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001871509-26-000012-34b2c6cc749dcf1b",
        "accession_number": "0001871509-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we engage directly with manufacturers to ensure compliance with negotiated contract pricing and requisite volume expectations.",
        "start_character": 19206,
        "end_character": 19345
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001871509-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001871509-26-000012-34b2c6cc749dcf1b",
        "accession_number": "0001871509-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also subject to the Americans with Disabilities Act (the “ADA”), which prohibits discrimination on the basis of disability in public accommodations and employment, which may require us to design or modify our restaurants to make reasonable accommodations for individuals with disabilities.",
        "start_character": 24166,
        "end_character": 24462
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001871509-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001871509-26-000012-34b2c6cc749dcf1b",
        "accession_number": "0001871509-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We compete within each market with national and regional chains and locally-owned restaurants for guests, management and hourly personnel and suitable real estate sites.",
        "start_character": 21905,
        "end_character": 22074
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001871509-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001871509-26-000012-34b2c6cc749dcf1b",
        "accession_number": "0001871509-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to pursue our substantial runway for growth by fine tuning our development approach, led by an emphasis on four-wall returns and a more gradual approach to new market entry to build the needed awareness, trial and demand for future restaurants.",
        "start_character": 9131,
        "end_character": 9387
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001871509-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001871509-26-000012-34b2c6cc749dcf1b",
        "accession_number": "0001871509-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have implemented and are executing several initiatives to support our objectives to attract, develop and retain team members, including at the executive level.",
        "start_character": 11686,
        "end_character": 11848
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001871509-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001871509-26-000012-34b2c6cc749dcf1b",
        "accession_number": "0001871509-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We provide a full spectrum of resources, from skill building to leadership development, in the organization.",
